==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|nb}} {{term|þjóð||people, nation|lang=non}}. From {{proto|Germanic|þeuda|lang=non}}. From {{proto|Indo-European|teuta|tribe}}. Cognate with Gothic {{term|𐌸𐌹𐌿𐌳𐌰}} and Norwegian {{term|tjod}}.
<!-- From http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theodiscus -->

